                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "First things first, I bought the Darksiders pack during a sale for ₹538, so I was already feeling pretty good about the value before I even started playing. Four games for that price? Sounds like a pretty good deal, right?\r\n\r\nI WAS NOT PREPARED FOR WHAT I WAS GETTING INTO.\r\n\r\nI went into Darksiders expecting a fun action game with a cool protagonist. What I got was an incredible world, memorable characters, fantastic dialogue, satisfying combat, and a story that genuinely made me care about what happened next.\r\n\r\nAnd WAR. OH MY GOD, WAR.\r\n\r\nThis man could say three words and somehow make them sound like the hardest thing you've ever heard. The dialogue in this game is genuinely something else. Every time War opens his mouth, there's a good chance you're about to hear a line that makes you sit there thinking, \"BRO, WHO WROTE THIS?\"\r\n\r\nThe atmosphere is fantastic, the world is interesting, and the cinematic presentation makes the entire adventure feel like you're participating in some massive mythological event.\r\n\r\nNow, is it perfect? No. The beginning is a little slow, and the gameplay takes some time to open up. If you're someone who gives a game only an hour or two before deciding whether to continue, you might not immediately see what makes this one special.\r\n\r\nBut PLEASE, give it a chance.\r\n\r\nBecause once everything starts coming together, this game becomes something genuinely special.\r\n\r\nI finished the story after roughly 26 hours on Steam, unlocked 30 out of 43 achievements, and I'm completely satisfied. I have absolutely no desire to replay the entire game just to collect the remaining achievements. I got the experience I wanted, and it was worth every minute.\r\n\r\nAnd now? I'm genuinely excited to play the rest of the franchise.\r\n\r\nVigil Games, if you're reading this, I hope you understand that you created something special here.\r\n\r\nI came for a game. I left wanting to know everything about this universe.\r\n\r\nAnd the fact that I got four games for ₹538 makes this purchase even more ridiculous in hindsight.\r\n\r\nSeriously, if you're considering buying Darksiders, especially during a sale, give it a shot. If you enjoy action-adventure games, memorable characters, cinematic storytelling, and a protagonist who speaks like every sentence costs him money, there's a lot to love here.\r\n\r\nBUY THIS GAME. GIVE WAR A CHANCE. YOU WILL UNDERSTAND.\r\n\r\nVigil Games, please accept this review as my formal application to your unpaid marketing department.\r\n\r\nI am willing to work for more Darksiders games.\r\n\r\nThank you. 😭❤️\r\n\r\nVerdict: Highly recommended. Five stars.",
